{"id":"3792e1826de54ef4","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-transfinite-induction.md","title":"序数域上的语义超限归纳","display":"df-transfinite-induction — 序数域上的语义超限归纳","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-transfinite-induction","aliases":["18-df-transfinite-induction","18-df-045"],"display":"df-transfinite-induction — 序数域上的语义超限归纳","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-transfinite-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-transfinite-induction</span><span>18-df-045</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transfinite-induction — 序数域上的语义超限归纳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\alpha\">\\(A\\subseteq\\alpha\\)</span> 是集合谓词的外延。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\\)</span> 在元语言中取真值，不是尚未编码的对象算术句。</p>\n<p>本节引入谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\,\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\beta\\ (\\gamma\\in A))\\to\\beta\\in A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\,\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\beta\\ (\\gamma\\in A))\\to\\beta\\in A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\to A=\\alpha\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\to A=\\alpha\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语义归纳由序数良序得到：若 α\\A 非空，取最小反例 β；其以下均在 A，进展性迫使 β∈A。对象理论中可证明的归纳句必须沿递归代码关系写出，不能直接将本节点中的任意序数对象塞进 PA 的语法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$（[[18-df-ordinal]]），$A\\subseteq\\alpha$ 是集合谓词的外延。$\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)$ 在元语言中取真值，不是尚未编码的对象算术句。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta<\\alpha\\,\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma<\\beta\\ (\\gamma\\in A))\\to\\beta\\in A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prog}_\\alpha(A)\\to A=\\alpha\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"98c11a88e50650e8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[18-df-transfinite-induction]] 的 $\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)$ 是元语言语义谓词；不把它当作 $I_{\\varepsilon_0}$ 的对象公式。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-transfinite-induction]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transfinite-induction]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transfinite-induction]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transfinite-induction|18-df-transfinite-induction]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-transfinite-induction|18-df-transfinite-induction]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b"]}